#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.static_eval.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.static\\_eval"
msgstr "cuda.tile.static\\_eval"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_eval:1 of
msgid "Evaluates the given Python expression at compile time."
msgstr "在编译期求值给定的 Python 表达式。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_eval:3 of
msgid ""
"The surrounded expression is evaluated using standard Python semantics, "
"not Tile semantics. It can reference global variables and local variables"
" from the surrounding tile function."
msgstr "所包裹的表达式将使用标准 Python 语义（而非 Tile 语义）进行求值。它可以引用全局变量以及外围 Tile 函数中的局部变量。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_eval:7 of
msgid ""
"If a referenced variable is a compile-time constant value, it will be "
"represented with a corresponding Python object of that value. For "
"example, a constant integer 3 will be passed as a plain ``int`` object of"
" value 3."
msgstr "如果引用的变量是编译期常量值，则会以对应该值的标准 Python 对象表示。例如，常量整数 3 将作为值为 3 的普通 ``int`` 对象传入。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_eval:11 of
msgid ""
"If a referenced variable has dynamic value, such as a tile or an array, "
"it will be passed as a proxy object that allows querying compile-time "
"attributes and building symbolic expressions from it. For example, if "
"``x`` is a dynamic tile, it will be represented as a ``ct.Tile`` object. "
"One can then use ``x.shape`` to obtain the tile shape as a tuple of "
"integers; ``x + 1`` will return a new proxy object that represents the "
"symbolic expression ``x + 1``, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果引用的变量具有动态值（例如 Tile 或数组），则会作为代理对象传入，允许查询编译期属性并基于其构建符号表达式。例如，若 ``x`` 是动态 "
"Tile，它将以 ``ct.Tile`` 对象的形式表示：此时可使用 ``x.shape`` 获取以整数元组表示的 Tile 形状； ``x + "
"1`` 将返回一个代表符号表达式 ``x + 1`` 的新代理对象，依此类推。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_eval:17 of
msgid ""
"The surrounded expression is allowed to return a proxy object for a "
"dynamic value. For example, this can be used to select one of multiple "
"dynamic expressions based on a compile-time condition: if ``N`` is an "
"integer constant and ``x``, ``y`` are dynamic tiles, then one can write "
"``res = ct.static_eval(x + 1 if N % 2 == 0 else y - 1)`` to select either"
" ``x + 1`` or ``y - 1`` at compile tile, depending on the parity of the "
"integer constant ``N``."
msgstr ""
"所包裹的表达式允许返回动态值的代理对象。例如，可用于根据编译期条件从多个动态表达式中择一返回：若 ``N`` 为整数常量且 ``x`` 、 "
"``y`` 为动态 Tile，则可编写 ``res = ct.static_eval(x + 1 if N % 2 == 0 else y - "
"1)`` ，从而在编译期根据整数常量 ``N`` 的奇偶性选择 ``x + 1`` 或 ``y - 1`` 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_eval:24 of
msgid ""
"The symbolic expression building feature is limited to basic arithmetic "
"operations. For example, ``ct.static_eval(ct.gather(array, 0))`` will "
"raise an error."
msgstr "符号表达式构建功能仅限于基本算术运算。例如， ``ct.static_eval(ct.gather(array, 0))`` 将会引发错误。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_eval:27 of
msgid ""
"The surrounded expression must not assign to local variables (e.g., via "
"the walrus operator ``:=``)."
msgstr "所包裹的表达式不得对局部变量赋值（例如不得使用海象运算符 ``:=`` ）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.static_eval:30 of
msgid ""
"Despite being declared as a function, `static_eval()` is treated like a "
"keyword: it skips the translation of the surrounded expression according "
"to the Tile semantics. Moreover, the expression is allowed to use the "
"full Python syntax, unlike the rest of the Tile code, which is limited to"
" a stricter subset of the language."
msgstr ""
"尽管在形式上声明为函数， ``static_eval()`` 会被当作关键字处理：它会跳过按照 Tile "
"语义对其所包裹表达式的转换。此外，与其余仅限于更严格语言子集的 Tile 代码不同，其中的表达式允许使用完整的 Python 语法。"

